  "description": "Soo-Hyun had been treated as a monster due to his white hair and unusual green-blue eyes. Everything about him was not normal which led him to live as a loner. Then one day, an angel named Noah unexpectedly came down to his room and talked to him. *“I’ll cure your erectile dysfunction.”* \n\nUnfortunately, instead of getting cured, Soo-Hyun got a side-effect in which he got an erection regardless of the time and situation due to the angel’s lack of power. Unaware of Soo-Hyun's embarrassment, Noah just smugly said *“Now, let’s show them how beautiful monster you are.”* \n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
